built on top of Envoy,

00:38:36.440 --> 00:38:40.460
so we put those additional
containers of Envoy

00:38:40.460 --> 00:38:46.170
as a sidecar to each pod
running our application.

00:38:46.170 --> 00:38:48.830
And thanks to that,
all the network traffic

00:38:48.830 --> 00:38:53.010
is going through those
proxies inside pods.

00:38:53.010 --> 00:38:56.960
This is one of the
most Istio features.

00:38:56.960 --> 00:38:59.150
And thanks to that,
Istio is going

00:38:59.150 --> 00:39:01.620
